<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<SubAppType Name="Softkey_Aux_IXA_TO_Remote_WRITE" Comment="VT-SoftKey lesen ODER AUX-Zuweisung (Joystick) lesen ODER lokaler Web-Override (z.B. vt-ui-mirror auf demselben Modul) + Remote-OPC-UA-Write an Zielmodul (generisch, ein Kanal, ohne Status-Feedback)">
	<Identification Standard="61499-2" Description="Copyright (c) 2026 Meisterschulen am Ostbahnhof  &#10; &#10;This program and the accompanying materials are made  &#10;available under the terms of the Eclipse Public License 2.0  &#10;which is available at https://www.eclipse.org/legal/epl-2.0/  &#10; &#10;SPDX-License-Identifier: EPL-2.0">
	</Identification>
	<VersionInfo Organization="Meisterschulen am Ostbahnhof" Version="1.0" Author="Franz Höpfinger" Date="2026-09-07" Remarks="Aus Softkey_Aux_IXA_TO_Remote_WRITE_BG_OPC herausgeloest: nur die Kommando-Seite (Quellen-ODER + Remote-Write), ohne Status-Feedback">
	</VersionInfo>
	<CompilerInfo packageName="MyLib::sys">
		<Import declaration="isobus::UT::Q::const::IDs::ID_NULL"/>
	</CompilerInfo>
	<SubAppInterfaceList>
		<InputVars>
			<VarDeclaration Name="u16ObjId" Type="UINT" Comment="Object ID SoftKey (VT)" InitialValue="ID_NULL"/>
			<VarDeclaration Name="u16ObjIdA" Type="UINT" Comment="Object ID AuxFunction2 (VT)" InitialValue="ID_NULL"/>
			<VarDeclaration Name="ID_WRITE_REMOTE" Type="WSTRING" Comment="Remote-Write-Adresse zum Zielmodul (Befehl, ACTION=WRITE, CLIENT)"/>
			<VarDeclaration Name="ID_WEB_READ" Type="WSTRING" Comment="Lokale Subscribe-Adresse fuer einen Web-Client (z.B. vt-ui-mirror) auf demselben Modul, ODER-verknuepft mit SoftKey und AUX"/>
		</InputVars>
	</SubAppInterfaceList>
	<SubAppNetwork>
		<FB Name="Softkey_IXA" Type="isobus::UT::io::Softkey::Softkey_IXA" x="-500" y="-1400">
			<Parameter Name="QI" Value="TRUE"/>
		</FB>
		<FB Name="Aux_IXA" Type="isobus::UT::io::Auxiliary::IN::Aux_IXA" x="-500" y="-400">
			<Parameter Name="QI" Value="TRUE"/>
		</FB>
		<FB Name="SUBSCRIBE_WEB" Type="adapter::net::AX_SUBSCRIBE_1" x="-700" y="700">
			<Parameter Name="QI" Value="TRUE"/>
		</FB>
		<FB Name="OR_MERGE" Type="adapter::booleanOperators::AX_OR_3" x="900" y="300">
		</FB>
		<FB Name="AX_CLIENT_1_0" Type="adapter::net::AX_CLIENT_1_0" x="2300" y="-200">
			<Parameter Name="QI" Value="TRUE"/>
		</FB>
		<DataConnections>
			<Connection Source="u16ObjId" Destination="Softkey_IXA.u16ObjId" dx1="846.67">
				<Attribute Name="Visible" Value="false"/>
			</Connection>
			<Connection Source="u16ObjIdA" Destination="Aux_IXA.u16ObjId" dx1="846.67">
				<Attribute Name="Visible" Value="false"/>
			</Connection>
			<Connection Source="ID_WEB_READ" Destination="SUBSCRIBE_WEB.ID" dx1="80">
				<Attribute Name="Visible" Value="false"/>
			</Connection>
			<Connection Source="ID_WRITE_REMOTE" Destination="AX_CLIENT_1_0.ID" dx1="613.33">
				<Attribute Name="Visible" Value="false"/>
			</Connection>
		</DataConnections>
		<AdapterConnections>
			<Connection Source="Softkey_IXA.IN" Destination="OR_MERGE.IN1" dx1="246.67"/>
			<Connection Source="Aux_IXA.IN" Destination="OR_MERGE.IN2" dx1="100"/>
			<Connection Source="SUBSCRIBE_WEB.OUT" Destination="OR_MERGE.IN3" dx1="100"/>
			<Connection Source="OR_MERGE.OUT" Destination="AX_CLIENT_1_0.IN" dx1="400"/>
		</AdapterConnections>
	</SubAppNetwork>
	<Attribute Name="Documentation" Type="CDATA"><![CDATA[<h1>SoftKey UND Aux → Remote-OPC-UA-Write (nur Kommando, kein Status)</h1>

<p>Kommando-Haelfte von <code>Softkey_Aux_IXA_TO_Remote_WRITE_BG_OPC</code>, herausgeloest als
eigener Baustein: SoftKey (<code>u16ObjId</code>), Aux-Zuweisung (<code>u16ObjIdA</code>) und ein
lokaler Web-Override (<code>ID_WEB_READ</code>) werden per <code>AX_OR_3</code> zusammengefuehrt
und per <code>AX_CLIENT_1_0</code> (<code>ID_WRITE_REMOTE</code>) ans Zielmodul geschrieben.</p>

<p>Kein Status-Feedback/Hintergrundfarbe hier - dafuer <code>AX_SUBSCRIBE_BG3_WEB_OPC</code>
danebenstellen (gleiche <code>u16ObjId</code>/<code>u16ObjIdA</code>-Werte durchreichen). Fuer die
komplette, vorverdrahtete Kombination beider Bausteine weiterhin
<code>Softkey_Aux_IXA_TO_Remote_WRITE_BG_OPC</code> verwenden.</p>
]]></Attribute>
</SubAppType>
